{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-05/1066185/block/singleImage/3280631/df/01KQR37784GBMWXS981A2XD921.jpg?updatedAt=1795775831\"/><figcaption>瑪嘉烈醫院。（資料圖片）</figcaption></figure><p>青衣發生工業意外。 今日（27日）下午4時31分，一名年約70歲老翁於青衣担杆山路88號一個船塢海上作業期間發生意外。警方和救援人員接報後趕至現場，據悉老翁一度陷入半昏迷狀態，救護員即場為他作初步治理後回復清醒，再由救護車送往瑪嘉烈醫院救治。警方正在調查意外成因。現場消息指，老翁為上址一間船廠的東主，疑操控小型吊臂時失控連人帶機墮海、一度被壓住雙腳。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T11:43:51.778037+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":189,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T10:37:11+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T17:57:32.509541+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T11:37:15.179363+00:00","content_hash":"8886d3a7c12cf9293644fc42f3a6c0c9a00e783b6858b4c134cf20c9d2678a06","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-27T11:43:51.778037+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}